{
  "//": [
    "Trimmed from `swift format dump-configuration`. Every key absent here",
    "keeps its toolchain default, so this file records only deliberate",
    "choices and does not drift as the toolchain evolves.",
    "",
    "`indentConditionalCompilationBlocks` is off because the boundary and",
    "benchmark targets wrap whole files in `#if canImport(UIKit)` and",
    "`#if DEBUG`; indenting those would reindent the entire file body.",
    "",
    "There is deliberately no `rules` block. swift-format REPLACES the rule",
    "dictionary rather than merging it, so naming even one rule here would",
    "silently disable every other default rule. Verify any future change",
    "with `swift format dump-configuration --effective`."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "indentation": {
    "spaces": 2
  },
  "indentConditionalCompilationBlocks": false,
  "lineLength": 100,
  "maximumBlankLines": 1,
  "respectsExistingLineBreaks": true,
  "spacesBeforeEndOfLineComments": 2
}
